BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:cultuurloket-digitall-implementatiebijdrage-2026@artificialnouveau.gith
 ub.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T150309Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
SUMMARY:Deadline: Cultuurloket DigitALL: Implementation Contribution (Imple
 mentatiebijdrage\, 2026)
DESCRIPTION:A one-off 2026 call letting Dutch cultural institutions reuse a
 nd adapt digital technology that other institutions have already built and
  published in the open DigitALL Toolkit\, for example translation software
  shared between theatres or a streaming platform adapted for a new venue. 
 Grants run up to EUR 30\,000 and cover technical modification\, integratio
 n\, production and deployment costs.\n\nOrganisation: Cultuurloket DigitAL
 L\nLocation: Netherlands and the Caribbean parts of the Kingdom. No city o
 r region restriction.\nAward: Up to EUR 30\,000. Covers technical modifica
 tion\, system integration\, production and deployment costs. Hardware purc
 hase alone is ineligible unless clearly essential to the public experience
 . No stated co-financing percentage. No application fee.\nDuration: Not sp
 ecified\; scoped to a single implementation.\n\nMore: https://cultuurloket
 digitall.nl/implementatiebijdrage/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&u
 tm_medium=referral
URL:https://cultuurloketdigitall.nl/implementatiebijdrage/?utm_source=artif
 icialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Netherlands and the Caribbean parts of the Kingdom. No city or reg
 ion restriction.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stimuleringsfonds-international-vouchers-2026@artificialnouveau.github.
 io
DTSTAMP:20261104T150309Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261027
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261028
SUMMARY:Deadline: International Vouchers
DESCRIPTION:Travel voucher for Dutch-based professionals in design\, archit
 ecture and/or digital culture who have been invited by a foreign party to 
 give a presentation\, lecture or workshop. To apply you must have submitte
 d an application to the Fund in the past five years that was positively as
 sessed (previous International Vouchers do not count).\n\nOrganisation: St
 imuleringsfonds Creatieve Industrie (Creative Industries Fund NL)\nLocatio
 n: Netherlands (for international travel)\nAward: Up to €1\,500 within E
 urope (zone 1) / up to €2\,500 outside Europe (zone 2)\nDuration: Per tr
 ip\n\nMore: https://www.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/international-vouch
 ers?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/international-vouchers?utm_s
 ource=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Netherlands (for international travel)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:cifnl-videotage-residency-2027@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T150309Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261021
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261022
SUMMARY:Deadline: Creative Industries Fund NL: Residency Videotage 2027 (Ho
 ng Kong)
DESCRIPTION:The Creative Industries Fund NL offers one residency at Videota
 ge\, the Hong Kong media art institute (est. 1986) known for critical work
  on XR\, AI\, blockchain and video games.\n\nOrganisation: Creative Indust
 ries Fund NL (Stimuleringsfonds Creatieve Industrie)\, with Videotage\nLoc
 ation: Hong Kong (Videotage premises). Only for applicants established in 
 the Netherlands\, Aruba\, Bonaire\, Curacao\, Saba\, Sint Eustatius or Sin
 t Maarten and registered with a Kingdom of the Netherlands business regist
 er (KvK).\nAward: One residency grant: EUR 5\,000 for a two-month work per
 iod or EUR 6\,500 for three months\, covering travel\, insurance\, living 
 expenses\, compensation for time invested\, and material and transport cos
 ts. Housing\, work space\, Videotage guidance and production costs are pai
 d by the Fund directly to Videotage on top of the grant\; accommodation is
  arranged by Videotage. No application fee.\nDuration: 23 March to 18 May 
 2027 (two months) or 23 March to 15 June 2027 (three months)\; state your 
 preferred period. Research period plus a concluding public presentation ev
 ent for Videotage's Hong Kong network.\n\nMore: https://www.stimuleringsfo
 nds.nl/en/grants/open-call-videotage?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk
 &utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/open-call-videotage?utm_sour
 ce=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Hong Kong (Videotage premises). Only for applicants established in
  the Netherlands\, Aruba\, Bonaire\, Curacao\, Saba\, Sint Eustatius or Si
 nt Maarten and registered with a Kingdom of the Netherlands business regis
 ter (KvK).
END:VEVENT
